# TODO: Customer Onboarding Guide

This guide should cover the end-to-end onboarding flow:

- LZ Service Account creation (Azure AD member account with email capability)
- AWS LZ Service Account creation (IAM user with AdministratorAccess)
- Terraform Cloud/Enterprise organization setup
- VCS integration (ADO or GitHub)
- Bootstrap workspace creation and initial import of existing resources
- Order of operations: account resource -> ARM/CloudFormation -> tenancy resource -> tenancy_account resources
- Marketplace registration flow (AWS and Azure)
- Required credentials collection and secure storage

This is a broader guide covering the full customer journey, separate from the
per-CSP prerequisite guides (azure-prerequisites, aws-prerequisites).

Reference: Old wiki "as build" documentation.
